<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">Daniel</book>
  <para style="h">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniel</para>
  <para style="mt">Daniel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Jehoiakim vaihawm kum, akum thumna ah Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar ahing kuon a Jerusalem ahing sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n Juda leengpa Jehoiakim leh Pasian inn sunga um leh bel phabep khat Nebukadnezzar khut ah apeta hi; Ama’n tam vante shinar gam a a pasien inn ah apeipi a, apasien gou kholna inn ah akoita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Nebukadnezzar in a michilgete lamkaipa Ashpenaz kungah Israel tate lah a, leengpa hahlesuonte leh miliente hahlesuonte pawl khat akunga hing zawpi ding in thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua mite pen, tangval asatunga melhemna umlou, melhoitah, pilna leh theina leh siemna lam a kizen tualeh theisiemna lam sil thei bai, leengpa innpi sunga na sem dinga ching, amaute pen Kaldai mite ham leh siemna ahil thei ding uh mite ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lengpa’n ama ann nehna annkuong a leengpa ann neh tui pen pente leh dawn ding guotsa diem in akoi hi. Kum thum sung tuabanga azil ding uh, tuazou chienga, leengpa nna asep ding uh, chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua tangvalte lah ah Juda tate: Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael leh Azariah atel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Akung uah michilge lamkai pan, amaute min ding uh aphuo pieh a: Daniel min dingin Belshazzar, Hananiah min dingin Shadrak, Mishael min dingin Meshak, tualeh Azariah min dingin Abed-Nego, aphuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Daniel in leengpa ann neh ahiei, ahisihleh uoin dawn ahiei a, kisuhbua lou ding alungtangin atum chinten a, tuaziehin michilgete lamkaipa kungah akisuhbua louna ding in angenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian in Daniel khu michilgete lamkaipa mitmu in deisahna leh lainatna aneisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh michilgete lamkaipa’n Daniel kungah, “Na neh ding uleh na dawn ding uh hing guot pieh ka pu leengpa ka giing hi; aziehpen bang dinga na khanguolpite sanga hoilou zaw a hing mu sese ding ahiei mah? Tuachi’n leengpa lah ah ka lutang zauhuoi sah ding na hi uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Daniel in Michilgete lamkaipa’n, Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael leh Azariah enkol dinga ase sawnpa kungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Na suohte ni sawm sung hing enkhie in hepitahin neh ding ante louhing leh dawn ding tuisih maimai hing pie u’heh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuazou chiengin, ka mel puoh dan u’leh leengpa ann neh ne tangvate mel puoh dan toh etkah hi henlen, tualeh na mu bang bangin na suohte tungah bawl in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n tami tungtang ah amauh athukimpi a, ni sawm sung amauh a enkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh ni sawm abeitah in, amel uh leengpa ann neh ne tangvalte mel sang a hoizaw leh atahsate uh thauzaw in akilangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tambangin amaute enkolpa’n aneh ding u’leh adawn ding ua kipie ann tuipente leh uointe ahemkhie a, ante louhing ngen apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasian in tam tangval lite zilna lam a siemna, theina leh pilna zousie a pie a; tualeh Daniel in mengmuna leh mangte zousie theisiemna anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lengpa’n amaute puilutna dinga ahun guot nite atuntah in, michilgete lamkai amaute leeng innpi sunga, Nebukadnezzar masang ah ahing zawpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n amaute ahoupi a, amaute zousie lah ah, Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael leh Azariah, toh kibang koima a um sih hi; tuaziehin amaun leengpa nna asemta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n pilna leh theisiemna lam thu a adoh zousie ah, aleenggam sung pumpi a, mitphieldawi siemte leh ai san siemte, zousie sangin alesawm a hoizaw in amaute amuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tambangin Daniel khu Lengpa Sairas vaihawm kum khatna tandong a umtoupeh nalai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebukadnazzer in avaihawm kum, akum ni na ah, Nebukadnezzar in, mang aman a, tuamin alungsim a subuoi a, a imu theita sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n mitphieldawisiemte ai san siemte, leh aasi lam siemte tualeh Kaldaimite khu leengpa mang hil dinga han dingin thu apie hi. Tuachi’n amaute ahing pei ua, leengpa mai ah adingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n akung uah, “Mang khat kaman a, tua mang thei ut in ka lungsim abuoi mama hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kaldaimiten leengpa kungah, Aramaik ham in, “Aw leengpa dam sawt in, na suohte kungah na mang hing hil in, akhiehna kang hil ding uh” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa’n adawnga, Kaldaimite kungah, “Tami ka thupuana dettah ahi: ka kunga ka mang leh akhiehna, nang theisah theisih uleh ahing kisatnen dinga, na innte uh vut vum asuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahivang in mang leh akhiehna na hing theisah thei ua ahileh, silpiehte, kipahmante leh zatatna thupitahte kei akipat na mu ding uhi. Tuazieh in mang leh akhiehna hing hil un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amauten adawng kia ua, akungah, “Lengpa’n asuohte kungah amang hing hil henlen, tuachieng in akhiehna ka hil ding uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lengpa’n adawnga akung uah, “Ka thupuana dettah na thei zieh ua, hun sawtsah sawm na hi uh chi chientah in ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mang khu ka kunga nang theisah sih uleh, nou a dingin thukiehna khat umsun a um hi! Hun kihen masang sie a ka mai a thuzuou leh thusie gen dinga kithukim hi uteh. Tuaziehin mang hing hil phot un, tuachi’n akhiehna nang hilchien thei ding uh chi ka thei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kaldaimiten leengpa adawng ua, akungah, “Leitung ah leengpa sil phut bawl thei ding koima um sih va! Tuazieh in koima leengpa, milien leh vaihawm hitaleh zong, mitphieldawi siemte, aisan siemte leh aasi lam siemte hita leh ama ua kipat tambang silphut anei ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lengpa sil nget pen sil hasatah ahi; mihingte lah a um hilou pasiente loungal midang koiman leengpa masangah ahil thei sih ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tambang dawnna in leengpa alungthah sah mama a, Babilon gam a mipil zousie thagamna ding thu apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipilte thana ding thukiehna apawtkheta a, Daniel leh alawmte zong tha dingin asuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Babilon mipilte that ding a kuondoh leengpa veng galkap lamkai Ariok kungah piltah leh lemguot siemtah in ama adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama’n leengpa galkap lamkai Ariok adonga, akungah, “Bangzieh a leengpa thuguot hichi talawm a kin ahiei mah?” Achi hi. Tuachi’n Ariok in sil umdan Daniel kungah athei sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Daniel alut a, leengpa kungah ama hun pe ding leh amang khiehna hilchienna dingin ava ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuazouin Daniel a inn ah apeita a, thu umdan zousie alawmte Hananiah, Mishael leh Azariahte kung ah atheisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Daniel leh alawmte nangawn zong Babilon mipil dangte toh thagam khawm a a um louna ding un, tam thuguh tungtanga van Pasian khotuona ngen dingin amauh ahilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n thuguh khu Daniel kungah zanlai mengmunain ahing kilangta hi. Tuachi’n Daniel in van Pasian aphatta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Pasian min kumtawn kumtawn in phat in umta hen, aziehpen pilna leh hatna Ama a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama’n hunte leh hunbite aheng a, Aman leengte alakhie a, leengte atung ding zel hi. Ama’n mipilte kungah pilna apie a, tualeh theisiemna neite kungah theina apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman sil thuh leh thuguhte aphuongdoh a, Miellah a umte Aman athei a, vah khu Ama toh um khawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw ka pu ka pate uh Pasian, Na tungah ka kipah a, Nang kang phat hi. Pilna leh vangletna nang pie a, Na kunga ka hing ngette uh, tuin na hing theisah a, leengpa thu ka kung uah na hing theisah ta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuazieh in leengpa’n Babilon mipilte thatgam dinga aguotpa Ariok kungah Daniel ava pei a, akungah tambangin agen a, “Babilon mipilte that vawt sin. Lengpa kungah kei hing zawpi inlen, Keima’n leengpa kungah amang khiehna ka hil ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ariok in leengpa kungah Daniel azawpi pai a, leengpa kungah tambangin agen hi, Lengpa kungah, “Mang khiehna hing hilchien thei ding Juda saltangte lah ah mi khat ka muta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lengpa’n adawnga, amin Belteshazzar kichipa Daniel kungah, “Nang maw ka manga ka mu leh akhiehna ka kunga na hing hilchien thei ding?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Daniel in leengpa adawnga, “Leengpa’n aphut thuguh khu Babilon mipilte, aasilam siemte, mitphieldawi siemte leh aisan siemte’n leengpa kungah ahil chien thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh thuguhte kilangsah leh leengpa Nebukadnezzar kunga, ni nukhia lam chienga, bang hing um ding ahiei chi theisah van ah Pasian khat a um hi. Na mang leh na lupna tunga na mengmute khu tamte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nang na hileh, Aw leengpa, tunua chienga bang hing um ding ahiei chi ngaituo kawm a na lupna tung a na lup lai in, thuguhte langsah zel pa’n, bang hing tung ding ahiei chi, nang ahing theisah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh Kei kahileh, ahing nalai midang koi ahiei khat sanga ka pil zoh zieh a ka kunga tami thuguh latsah ahisih a, Aw leengpa akhiehna na theina ding leh na lungsim sunga um na theisiemna ding ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Lengpa aw, nang milim lientah khat na en a, namu hi. Tam milim lientah, te sesol khu na masang ah adingta hi, tualeh amel um dan khu achizat huoi mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tam milim lutang khu sana siengtah ahi a, a awm leh abante khu dangka ahia, agil leh apheipite khu sum-eng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Akengte khu sia ahi a, akephangte sia leh tungman kihal a kibawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuabanga na etlaitah in, mihing khut a laidoh hilou suongtum khat in, tua milim kephang sia leh tungman kihal laitah a deng a, aden guoi dimdem na mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua sia, tungman, sum-eng, dangka leh sanate khu ahing kehnen siengta a, nipi lai a buphuol a bushi bang ahing hita uhi. Tualeh hui in tuate atawmang sienga, a umna uh akitheita sih hi. Tualeh tua milim deng guoi dimdem suongtum pen muol lienpi ahing suoh a, leitung pumpi adimsuohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Tami ahi na mang. Tuin leengpa mai ah akhiehna ka hing hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nang pen na hileh Aw leengpa, leengpate leengpa na hi. Van Pasian in nang pen, leenggam leh silbawltheina, thahatna leh thupina ahing pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />tualeh mihingte tenna pouma leh gam lah a gamsate leh vanlaizawl a vate tenna pouma, Aman na khut ah ahing peta hi, tualeh atung ua vaihawm in ahing bawlta hi. Tami sana lutang khu nangma na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh nangma nua ah, nang sanga ngiemzaw leenggam dang khat adingdoh ding hi. Tuazou chiengin, leenggam thumna sum-eng leenggam dangkhat leitung pumpi a vaihawm ding ahing dingdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh leenggam lina khu sia banga khau ahi dinga; sia in akehnen sah a, sil zousie anuoisie bang maiin, tualeh sia in tamte asuhguoi bangin, ama’n zong leenggam dangte asuguoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua milim kephang leh akengmete, belkhengpa tungman leh sia kihal na mu bang bangin tam leenggam akikhen ding a, hinanleh sia leh tungman kihal na mu ma bangin, ama ah sia khauna a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh akengphang a akengmete kimkhat sia, kimkhat tungman ahibangin, leenggam in hatna leh zawnkhalna anei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Sia leh tungman kihal na mu bangin, amau’khu mihing tate toh akizahal ding ua, hinanleh sia leh tungman akihalkhawm theilou mabangin tua leenggam mite zong khat leh khat akipumkhat thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tam leengte vaihawm hun sungin, van Pasian in bangchihtan a susiet ngailou ding leenggam khat aphutdoh dinga, tua leenggam khu midangte kung a nuasie ahisih ding. Tam leenggam in leenggam dangte zousie a gawtguoi sieng dinga, asubei sieng ding a, ama pen kumtawn in ading den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Muol a kipat, mihing khut a laidoh hilou, suongtum na mu khu akhiehna tami ahi. Tua suongtumin, siate, sum-eng te, tungmante, dangkate leh sanate, agawtguoi mabangin, Pasian thupitah in tunua chienga bang hing um ding ahiei chi leengpa kung ah, a theisah ta ahi. Tualeh mang khu akichien a ahilchienna zong adih ahi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Nebukadnezzar Daniel masang ah abohkhupa, pahtawina apie a, tualeh amasanga sillat leh gimnamtuite lan dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Lengpa’n Daniel adawnga, akungah, “Adihtah in na Pasian khu pasiente Pasian leh leengte Mangpa thuguhte sulangpa ahi tahtah hi; tuazieha tam thuguhte na sulat thei ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Daniel akaisang sah a, silpieh lien tahtah tampi apie a, tualeh Babilon pumpi tunga vaihawmtu leh Babilon gam a mipilte zousie tunga lamkai lienpen in abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n Daniel in leengpa kunga, angetna bangin leengpa’n, Shadrak, Meshak, Abednegote zong, Babilon gam tunga vaihawm in akoi a, Daniel pen leengpa vaihawm thukhenna ah atou denta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Nebukadnezzar in sana milim khat tong sawmguh a sang, tongguh a lien abawl a, ama’n tua khu Babilon gamkai a um Dura phaijang ah atungdoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Lengpa Nebukadnezzar in gamkai neuzaw uhte, vaihawmte, uhpipate, thumoptute, thukhen mite, sumkemte, dansiemte, gamkai tenga vaihawmte zousie, leengpa Nebukadnezzar milim tundoh latna a hing tel dingin ahankhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamkai neuzaw uhte, vaihawmte, uhpipate, sumkemte, thukhente, dansiemte leh gamkai teng a vaihawm zousiete, leengpa Nebukadnezzar milim tundoh latna ah, ahing peikhawm ua, tua milim masangah adingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n tangkoupa aw ngaitah in ahing kikou a: “Na kung uah tami thupieh ahi, Aw michin, namchin leh hamchin a mite aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pengkulte, theilete, kaigingte, gawsemte, nawtgingte, tumging bi ni neite, silging chinteng gin na zah chiengun, na bohkhup chiet ding ua, leengpa Nebukadnezzar in atundoh milim na bieh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabang a bohkhup loua belou pouma, haltuina meiphuolpi sunga pailut pai ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi zousiein Pengkulte, theilete, kaigingte gosemte, nawtgingte leh silging chinteng gin azah tahun, mipi zousie, nam zousie leh ham chin a mite, abohkhup ua, leengpa Nebukadnezzar milim tundoh khu abeta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin tua hun laiin, Kaldaimi koite ahiei, amai lam ah ahing pei ua, Judate ahing heh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amauten leengpa ahoupi ua akungah, “Aw leengpa dam sawt in! achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangman Aw leengpa, michin in, pengkulte, theilete, Kaigingte, gosemte, nawtgingte, tumging bi ni neite leh silging chinteng gin azah chieng ua, bohkhup a tua sana milim abieh ding uh ahi, chiin thupieh na bawl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh koipou tuabanga, bohkhup lou a, belou pouma haltuina meiphuolpi sunga pailut ding ahi, chiin thupieh na bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babilon gamkai sunga vaihawm dinga na koi, Shadrak, Meshak leh Abednego, kichi Juda mi koite ahiei a um ua, Aw leengpa tam miten, nang bangma’n ahing simsih ua, amaun na pasiente nna zong asem sih ua, na sana milim tundoh zong abe nuom sih uhi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nebukadnezzar thangpai leh lungthah tahin, Shadrak, Meshak leh Abednegote hing zawpi dingin thu apie hi. Tuachi’n amaun tam mite leengpa mai ah ahing zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nebukadnezzar in amauh ahoupi a akung uah: “Shadrak, Meshak leh Abednego, ka pasiente nna na sem sih ua, ka sana milim tundoh zong na be sih uh, kichi adih ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu in bang hun hitaleh, Pengkulte, theilete, kaigingte, gosemte, nawtgingte, tumgingte leh silging chinteng gin, na zah chieng ua, bohkhup a ka milim tundoh be dinga na kiman uleh, ahoi! Hinanleh na bieh sih u’leh pen, haltuina meiphuolpi sunga pailut na hi pai ding uhi. Ka khut sunga kipat noute hing hundoh ding tua Pasian koi ahiei mah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Shadrak, Meshak leh Abednegoten leengpa adawng ua, akungah, “Aw Nebukadnezzar tam thu ah hing dawng vateh da kon va ung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuabang ding ahitahleh zong, ana ka sep uh Pasian in, haltuina meiphuolpi apat ahing hundoh thei a, tualeh Aman na khut apat ahing hundoh ding hi, Aw leengpa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh ahing hunkhe sihta zongin, Aw leengpa na pasiente nna ka sem sih ding ua, na sana milim tundoh zong ka be sih ding uhi, Aw leengpa, achi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nebukadnezzar khu Shadrak, Meshak leh Abednego tungah alungthah sengsenga, amel puohdan ahing kiheng vawtta hi. Tuaziehin ama’n haltuina meiphuolpi khu asat dan ngaina sanga ale sagi a satsah dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh aman agalkapte lah a mi hatpente Shadrak, Meshak leh Abednego kantom a, haltuina meiphuolpi sunga pailut dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam mite apuonahtuol utoh, atokatuol utoh, adielkhipte utoh akantom ua, haltuina meiphuolpi sungah pailut in a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuazieh in leengpa thupieh lah akinaw a, haltuina meiphuolpi lah asat seng ziehin, meikuongin Shadrak, Meshak leh Abednego meiphuolpi a pailutte akalumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh tam mi thumte, Shadrak, Meshak leh Abednegote, kantomsain haltuina meiphuolpi sungah akesuhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Nebukadnezzar khu lamdang sa sengin kintah in adingdoh a, athudohmite kungah: “I kantom a meiphuolpi sunga ipailut uh mithum hilou ahi uoi mah?” Chiin adong hi. Amaun adawng ua, leengpa kungah adih hi, “Aw leengpa” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aman: “En vawi un, mi li phelsa a um, mei lah a vah kawikawi ka mu a, bangma achi sih uhi; tualeh alinapa melpuoh dan Pasian tapa abang hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nebukadnezzar khu haltuina meiphuolpi gei ah ahing pei a, “Thu agen a, Shadrak, Meshak leh Abednego, noute Pasian tungnung pen suohte, hing pawtdoh unlen tanah hing pei un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Shadrak, Meshak leh Abednego te meikuong lai akipat in ahing pawtdohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh gamkai neuzaw uhte, vaisaite, uhpipate leh leengpa thudohmite ahing kikhawm ua, tam mite tahsa tungah meikuongin thuneina anei sih a, alutung ua sam zam khat zong akasih a, apuonsilte u’zong meiin akasih a, atahsa tung u’zong meikhu gim anam sih uh chi amuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nebukadnezzar in thu agen a, “Shadrak, Meshak leh Abednego Pasian phat in umta hen, Ama’n avansawlsieng ahing sawl a, Ama muong asuohte ahundoh hi. Tualeh amaun leengpa thu asang sih ua, tualeh amaun a Pasian uh chilou pasien dang mawngmawng abieh louna dingun leengpa thupieh sulamdangin atahsa uh apephal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n michin, namchin leh hamchin a mi koipou Shadrak, Meshak leh Abednego Pasian tunga thu hoilou gen pouma sat nen in a um ding a, a innte uh vutvum asuoh ding hi, chiin thupieh ka bawl ahi; aziehpen tambang hundohthei Pasian dang a um sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n, Shadrak, Meshak leh Abednegote Babilon gamkai sungah akaisang sahta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Nebukadnezzar in michinte, namchinte, hamchinte leh leitung pumpi a tengte kungah na tung uah hamuonna suhpungin umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tungnungpen Pasian in kei a dinga, abawl chiemtenate leh sil lamdangte, phuondoh hoi kasa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Achiemtenate athupi senga, a sillamdangte anasa seng hi! Aleenggam khu kumtawn leenggam ahi a, avaihawmna zong akhang akhangin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei Nebukadnezzar ka inn ah ka khawldam a, ka leeng innpi huongsungah nuomtah in ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mang khat ka manta a tua mangin ahing zau sah mama hi; ka lupna tunga ka ngaituonate leh ka lutanga mengmunaten, ahing subuoi mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka mang khiehna ka kunga, ahing theisah theina dingun, Babilon mipil zousie ka mai a, hing puikhawm dingin thupieh khat ka bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n mitphieldawi siemte, aasi lam siemte Kaldaimite leh ai san siemte, ahing peikhawm ua, tualeh ken amauh ka mang ka hil a, hinanleh amaun ka mang khiehna, ahing theisah thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh atawpah, ka pasien min dungzui a amin kiphuo Belteshazzar kichi asunga Pasian Siengthou hagau neipa Daniel ka masang ah ahing pei a, tualeh ken amasang ah ka mang ka hilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Aw Belteshazzar mitphieldawi siemte lamkaipa Pasian ziehin leh thuguh bangma in ahing subuoi sih chi ka thei ziehin, ka mang a kilahna ka mu leh akhiehna hing hilchien in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lupna tunga ka luplai a, ka mengmute tamte ahi: Ka khodah leh, Ngai in, leitung laizang tah ah, singkung pou khat ka mu a, asandan anasa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Singkung khu ahing khang lien a, ahat mama a, asan lam in van asutou a, kawlmong tawp tandongin akimupha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anate a etlawm a, agapha mama hi, tua khu mi zousie a dingin ann ahi a, gamlah a gamsaten alim nuoi abel ua, abazamte ah tungleeng vate ateng uhi, tualeh ganhing zousie tua singkung apat akivah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ka lupna tunga ka lup laiin, mengmunate ka mu a, ngai vawi, vengtu misiengthou khat van a pat ahing kumsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama ngaitah in akikou a, tambangin agen hi, tua sing khu phua inlen, abazamte satkhie inlen, anate heu inlen, agate thethangin, gamsate alimnuoi apat taimang uhenlen, abate apat in vate leengmang uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanlezong abulsum leh athahui zungte gamlah ah siakhau leh sum-eng gui a hensa in hampa dawng lah ah nuasie in um hen. Van daitui in ama pahsah henlen, leitunga hampate gamlah a gamsate toh nekhawm uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Alungtang khu mihing lungtang apat kiheng henlen, gamsa lungtang pieh hihen; tualeh atung ah hun sagi beisah hi heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tungnung sangpen in mihingte leenggam ah vai ahawm a, a ut ut kungah apie a, mi nuoinungpente zong atungding zel hi chi, mihingten atheina ding un, vengtu misiengthouten tam thupuana leh thutanna aphuongdoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam mang khu Kei leengpa Nebukadnezzar in ka man a, ka leenggam sung a mipil koima’n akhiehna ahing hil theilou ziehin, tuin Belteshazzar aw, nang hing khiehpieh inlen hing theisah in, aziehpen Pasian Siengthou hagau nangma ah a um hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Daniel amin Belteshazzar kichipa khu hun khat sung lamdangsa in abuoi a, angaituonaten apatausah mama hi. Tuachi’n leengpa’n “Belteshazzar aw, mang leh akhiehna in kisubuoisah sin,” achi hi. Belteshazzar in adawngta hi. “Ka pu mang pen nang hing mudate a ding hi henlen, akhiehna zong na melmate ading hizaw heh, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na singkung mu, hing khanglien a, hing phungchinga, asan lam in van su a, kawlmong tawp donga kimupha a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />anate etlawm a, agapha mama a, ganhing zousie ann neh ding pie a, alim nuoi a gamsate tenga, abazamte a tungleeng vaten umna a aneina u’khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua singkung hing khang a hing hatta khu, Aw leengpa, Nangma na hi. Na thupina ahing khangtou a, van asuta a, na vaihawmna leenggam in kawlmong tawptan aphata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Lengpa’n van akipat vengtu Misiengthou khat hing kumsuh a mu a, Sing khu phua inlen, sumangin, ahivangin abulsum pen athahuite siakhau leh sum-eng gui a hensa in leitunga hampa dawngte lah ah nuasie in. Tualeh van daitui in pahsah henlen, gamlah gamsate toh hampa ne khawm heh, atunga hun sagi abei masangsie, hing chi na mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lengpa aw tami akhiehna ahi; tualeh tami ka pu leengpa tung a hing tungding Tungnung Sangpen thupieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihingte lah a kipat ahing delmang ding ua, na tenna ding khu gamlah a gamsate lah ahi ding a, bawngtal bangin hampa ahing nesah ding ua, van daitui in na pah ding hi. Tualeh Tungnung Sangpen in mihingte leenggamah vai ahawm a, a ut ut kungah ape zel hi chi na hing theidoh masangsie in, na tungah hun sagi abei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh singkung bulsum leh athahuite nuasie ding a thupieh pen ahileh, van in vai ahawm chi na hing theidoh nua chiengin na leenggam khu nanga dingin suhdet kia ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin Aw leengpa ka hing thuhilna nanga dingin pomtah hihen; na khelnate tawpsan inlen sildih bawlin, na gitlouna tawpsan inlen, mi genthei tung ah khotuona langsah in. Tamte’n na nopsahna asusau khamaw sih ding hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tamte zousie leengpa Nebukadnezzar tungah ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ha sawm leh ni abei nua in, leengpa Babilon leeng innpi sunga avah kawi kawi lai in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />leengpa’n thu agen a, “Tami Babilon thupitah khu, leenggam innpi dinga ka silbawltheina hatna leh ka thupina zatatna dinga, ka lamdoh hilou ahiei mah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lengpa kam sunga tua thute a um nahlai sungin, van a kipat aw khat ahing kumsuh a, “Aw leengpa Nebukadnezzar na kungah thu akigen hi: Leenggam nang akipat apeimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh nang pen mite lah apat in ahing delmang ding ua, gamsate toh na tengkhawm dinga, bawngtal bangin hampa na ne ding a, tualeh Tungnung Sangpen in mihingte leenggam tung ah vaiahawm a, a ut ut kungah ape zel hi chi na hing theidoh masangsie in, na tung ah hun sagi abei ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuami dahkal mama in tua thute Nebukadnezzar tungah ahing tangtung paita a, ama pen mite lah akipat delmangin a umta a, bawngtal bangin hampa aneta hi; Asamte muvanlai mul ahing bah a, achinte zong vate chin ahing bah masang sie in, van daitui in apumtangin apah sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh tua hunte abeitahin, Kei Nebukadnezzar vanlam en in ka dahtou a, ka theisiemnate ka kungah ahing kinuale kiata hi; tualeh ken Tungnung Sangpen ka pahtawi a, ka phat a, zatatna ka pie hi: Aziehpen, Ama thuneina khu kumtawn thuneina ahi a, Aleenggam zong akhang akhangin a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Leitunga tengte zousie khu, bangmalou banga ngai ahi ua, Aman van galkapte lah leh, leitunga tengte lah ah a ut bangbangin, abawl a koiman akhut atutang thei sih a ahisihleh “Bang ahiei na bawl” achi thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua hun laitah mama in ka kingaituotheina ka kungah ahing kinuale kia a, tualeh ka leenggam thupina dingin, ka zatat huoina leh ka thupina ka kungah ahing kinuale kiata hi. Tualeh ka thukikuppite leh ka milienten ahing suidoh ua, ka leenggam ah suhdetin ka um kiata a, thupina nasa zawsem ka kungah belapin aum ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuin Kei Nebukadnezzar in, van leengpa ka phat a, ka tawisanga, zanate ka pie hi; Anasep zousie thutah ahi a, alampi zousie dihna ahi. Tualeh mi kisatheitah a gamtate, Aman asungiem thei hi achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Belshazzar in a miliente tul khat a ding in, annkuong thupitah alui a, tul khatte masang ah zu adawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Belshazzar in zu achep lai in, apa Nebukadnezzar in, Jerusalem biehinn apat a ahing puoh, sana leh dangka noute a, leengpa leh amiliente leh azite leh a meiten zu a dawn theina ding un, tua noute hing tawi dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem a Pasian biehinn akipata kiladoh sana noute ahing lata ua, tuachi’n leengpa leh amiliente leh azite leh a meiten, tua noute in zu adawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuabang zu adawn kawm un amauten, sana, dangka leh sum-eng leh sing leh suong a kibawl pasiente aphatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thakhat in mihing khutme ahing kilangdoh a, leengpa innpi sunga thaumei tunna toh kitang bang ahing gielta hi; tualeh leengpa’n tua khut tumbong lai giel khu amuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa mel ahing kihengta a, angaituonatein asubuoita a, akengte ahing zawi a, akhupte ahing kitat tuota hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lengpa’n aasi lam siemte, Kaldaimite leh aisan siemte hing puilut dingin ngaitah in akikouta hi. Tualeh leengpa’n Babilon mipilte kungah thu agen a, akung uah: “Tam lai kigiel sim a, agen leh alena ka kunga hing hil thei pouma, puonsandup silsah ahi dinga, angawng ah sana khainieng awsah ahi ding a, leenggam sungah vaihawm athumna in apang ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa mipilte zousie ahing lut ua, hinanleh amaun lai kigiel asim thei sih ua, alena zong leengpa kungah atheisah theisih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Belshazzar nasatah in alungbuoita mama a, amel puohdan ahing kihengta a, miliente zong achiza siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lengnu’n leengpa leh a miliente kikou husa azahtah in annkuong luina inndan sungah ahing lut a; tualeh Lengnu’n thu agen a: “Aw leengpa dam sawt in, na ngaituonaten hing patausah sih heh, na mel puohdan zong kiheng sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na leenggam sungah, asunga Pasian Siengthou hagau tenna mi khat a um hi. Na pa damlai in, pasiente pilna bang, lungsim chiim leh theisiemna leh pilna nei ahilam ama ah akimu hi. Na pa, kachi Lengpa Nebukadnezzar in tua mipa mitphieldawi siemte, aisan siemte, aasilam siemte mangsan siemte lamkai lienpen a apansah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungsim hoitah, theina leh theisiemna, mangte khiehna, silhasate theichientheina, thubuoite genveng theina nei ahi lam zong akimu hi; leengpa’n Belteshazzar achipa a um hi, tuin Daniel hat hi henlen, tuachi’n aman ahilchienna ahing hil mai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Daniel leengpa mai ah ahing puilut ua, tualeh leengpa’n Daniel ahoupi a, akungah “Lengpa ka pa’n Judate lah apata a puidoh Juda saltang mite lah a Daniel kichipa na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na sung ah Pasian hagau a um a, lungsimpilna leh theisiemna leh pilna hoitah nangma ah akimu hi chi, ka naza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu in mipilte, aasilam siemte, tam lai kigiel sim ding leh, agente hing hilchien dingin ka masang ah ahing puilut ua, hinanleh ahing hilchien thei a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangman hilchiennate na bawl thei a, silhasate na genveng thei hi chi ka naza hi. Tuin laigel na simthei a ahilchiennate ka kunga na hing theisah thei leh puonsandup silsah in na um dinga, na ngawngah sana khainieng na awding a, leenggam sung ah vaihawmlien thumna in na pang ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Daniel in adawnga, leengpa mai ah, “Na silpiehte nangma ading hi henlen, na nuommante zong midang kung ah pie in. Ahivang in lai kigiel khu leengpa kung ah ka sim dinga, ahilchienna ka theisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lengpa aw, Tungnung Sangpen Pasian in na pa Nebukadnezzar, leenggam leh vangletna, thupina leh pahtawinate ana pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh akunga apieh vangletna zieh in, michin namchin leh ham chinteng amasangah achitun ua azau uhi. A ut ut athat a, a ut ut ahing khawi a, atawisang nuomte atawisang a, asuhngiem utte a sungiem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh alungtang ahing kisathei a, kiletsahna a alungsim ahing khau tah in, aleengtoupha apat kaikhieh in a um a, athupina alahpiehta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama mihingte lah akipat delmangin a umta a, alungtang gamsa banga bawl in a umta a, tualeh gam sabiltungte lah ah atenga, bawngtal bangin hampa nein a kivah hi. Tungnung Sangpen Pasian in mihingte leenggam ah vaiahawm a, a ut pouma vaihawm dingin aguot hi, chi atheidoh masangsie in, van daituiin apah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh nang atapa Belshazzar aw, tamte zousie thei napiin na lungtang na ngiemkhieh nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kingiemkhieh nahsangin van Mangpa douin na kitawisang a; abiehinn anoute na masang ah na lasah a, nang leh na miliente leh na zite leh na meiten zu dawnna in na zang uhi. Tualeh mutheilou, zatheilou, thei-theilou, sana, dangka, sum-eng sia leh sing leh suong a, kibawl pasiente phat in na pahtawi hi, tualeh Pasian akhut a na haitheina kempa leh na gamtat dan zousie Ama a hipa khu na pahtawi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tuachi’n khutmete Ama akipat sawl in ahing um a, tualeh tam lai ahing gielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh lai kigiel khu tami ahi: “MENE, MENE TEKEL UPHARSI.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua thumalte akhiehna tamte ahi: ‘MENE’: Pasian in leenggam vaihawmna nite asim a abeisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘TEKEL’ Tena ah tein na um a, na ching zou tasih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />‘PERES’: Na leenggam akihawmzah a, Medes leh Persiate kunga pieh ahita, achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Belshazzar in thu apie a, tuachi’n Daniel puonsandup asilsah ua, a ngawng ah sana khainieng a awsah ua, tualeh leenggam sung vaihawm lien thumna a pang ding ahi chiin ama toh kisai in thuphuon abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuami zan mama in Kaldaimite leengpa Belshazzar tha in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Medesmi Darius, kum sawmguh leh ni a upa ahi kum in leenggam alata hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darius in aleenggam pumpi tunga vaihawm dingin uhpi za leh sawmni, agamkai teng tungah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tamte tungah uhpipate thum akoi kia a, tuate lah ah Daniel khat ahi. Lengpa a dinga manna a umlouna dingin uhpi neuzawten, amaute kungah thu leh la atut sawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam Daniel khu uhpipate leh uhpi neuzawte sanga deisah tuom in a um a, ama a lungsim hoitah mu a a um ziehin, leengpa’n ama khu, a leenggam pumpi tunga koi ding angaituo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n uhpipate leh gamkai neuzaw uhmiten gamsung vaihawmna toh kisai in Daniel hehsietna ding a suita ua, hinanleh hehna ding amu thei sih uhi, ama mi dihtat, muonhuoi leh lungsimsie neilou ahizieh in asietna bangma amu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam miten: “A Pasian dan tungtang lam toh kisai ahilou ngal leh tam Daniel hehna ding mu ngai sih vai,” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n uhpipate leh gamkai neuzaw uhmite leengpa kungah ahonpi un ahing hawkhawm ua, akungah tambang in ahing gen uhi: “Aw leengpa Darius damsawt in, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lenggam uhpipate, vaihawmte, gamkai neuzaw uhmite, thudohmite leh thumopmite zousie ka kihou khawm ua, tuban ni sawmthum sunga nang kung chiloungal, mi dang ahiei, pasien dang ahiei, kunga thungetna nei pouma, humpibahnei kul sungah pailut in um hen, chi leeng innpi thupieh um henlen tua khu suhdet hiheh, chiin ka kithukim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin Aw leengpa thupieh namdet inlen, Medes leh Persia dan lamdang ngailou dungzui a akihen lamdang thei louna dingin laikigiel khu suoi kaikhum in, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Darius in Dan kigiel tungah suoi akaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuin Daniel in lai kigiel tungah suoi akikaita chi atheitah in inn langah apeita hi. Tualeh a inndan tungnung ah akaltou a, Jerusalem lam nga in akottate ahong a, ni dang a anabawl ngaina bangin, ni khat in thumvei a Pasian masang ah, thu angen a, tualeh kipah thu agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam mite ahing kikhawm ua, Daniel a Pasian masanga panpina ngen a athunget laitah ahing muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute leengpa kungah ahing pei ua, leengpa thupieh tungtang ahing gen ua: “Aw Lengpa, ni sawmthum sung mawngmawng nangma kung loungal pasien dangte kung ahiei, ahisihleh mi dang kung mawngmawng a thungetna nei a um pouma leh humpibahnei kul sung a pailut ding thupieh khautah ah suoi na kai sih amah?” ahing chi uhi. Lengpa’n adawnga: “Tua thupieh Medes leh Persia dan kiheng theilou dungzui in akiheng sih hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun adawng ua, leengpa masang ah: “Lengpa aw, Juda saltaangte lah a mi Daniel in, nang bangma in ahing ngai sih a, na suoikaina na thupieh lah bangma in asim sih hi, ni khat in thumvei thungetna abawl nalai lai hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam thute azah tah in leengpa alungdong mama a, tuachi’n Daniel huhdoh ding alungsim in angaituo a, ni tum masangsie in ahuhdohna ding ngaituo in theitawp suo in asem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam mite leengpa kungah ahing peikhawm kia ua, leengpa kungah: “Aw leengpa, Medes leh Persia dan a leengpa’n anamdetsa thupieh leh danthu mawngmawng kiheng theilou ahi,” ahing chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n thupieh apie a, Daniel ahing zawpi ua, humpibahnei kul sungah apailutta uhi. Hinanleh leengpa’n Daniel ahoupi a, akungah, “A nna nasep ngitnget na Pasian in hing hunkhe nava,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n suongtum khat ahing la ua, humpibahnei kul kot akha ua, Daniel tungtang a siltup akihen thei nawnlouna dingin, leengpa’n ama suoi namna khutsip leh amiliente suoi namna khutsip in anam chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin leengpa aleeng innpi ah apeita a, ann ngawl in zan tungtawn in azanhah a, amasangah tumging malmal ahing tawi sih ua, ama lah a imu thei vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa zingmawng matahin athou a, humpibahnei kulpi lam ah kintah in apei pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh kul ahing tuntah in, kaa aw pumin Daniel han in akikou a: Lengpa’n Daniel ahoupi a akungah, “Aw Daniel Pasian hing suohpa ana nasep ngitnget na Pasian in humpibahneite lah apat ahing hunkhe thei nai mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Daniel in leengpa kungah, “Lengpa aw damsawt in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka Pasian in avansawlsiengte ahing sawl a, kei ahing suhnat louna ding un humpibahnei kamte ahum pieh hi; Ama masanga mawna neilou ka hizieh leh, Aw leengpa nangma masanga zong bangma ka bawl khiellou ziehin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa ama ziehin akipah seng senga, tua kul sung apat Daniel ladoh dingin thu apie hi. Tuachi’n Daniel kul sung apat akiladohta a, asatung ah liemna mawngmawng akimu sih hi, Pasian agintat ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa thupiehin, adihloupi a Daniel hehte ahing zawpi ua, humpibahnei kulpi sungah azite u’leh atate u’toh pailut in a umta uhi, tualeh anuoi a atuhsuh masang un humpibahneiten ana eehmal gawp ua, agu atangte uh atawngsah siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Darius in leitung pumpi ateng michin, namchin leh ham chintenga mite kungah lai agiel a, “Hamuonna na kung uoh suhpungin umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka leenggam thuneina mun china um miten, Daniel Pasian masangah chitun in zau uheh. Aziehpen Ama Pasian hing ahi a, kumtawn a umden ahi. Ama leenggam suhsiet ahi ngai sih dinga, aleenggam thuneina in bei ni anei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman a hunkhie a, ahundoh hi, Aman van leh leitung ah, chiemtenate leh sillamdangte abawl a, Daniel khu humpibahnei thahatna akipat ahunkheta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam Daniel khu Darius vaihawm sungteng leh Persia mi Sairas vaihawm sungteng, alawching a, amavang denta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Belshazzar leenga apan kum khatna kum in, Daniel alupna tunga alup laiin mang aman a, alungsim ah mengmute ahing kilang hi. Tuachi’n amang agielkhie a, athupite kimtah in ahil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Daniel in thu agena, “Zanlai, ka mengmuna ah ka mu a, tualeh ngai in, van hui li ten tuipi amut a, akilohsah zuazua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh tuipi apat gamsa lienpipi akibanglou chiet li ahing pawt tou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amasa pen humpibahnei abanga, muvanlai hate anei hi. Ahate akibawdoh masangsiein ka en a, tua gamsate leitung apat dopkang in a um a, mihing bangin keng in akiding sah a, mihing lungtang pieh in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh thakhat in gamsa dang, anina vompi bang a um a, tuapen asihlangkhat apat akidomkangtou a, akamsunga aha kikal ah nahgu thum anei hi. Tualeh tambangin agen uhi: Thou inlen tahsa tampi nekhawng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zou a ka et leh gamsa dang, kamkei bang khat ahing kilang a, a eljang ah va ha bangbang ha li anei hi. Tua gamsa in lutang li zong anei a, vaihawmna thuneina akunga pieh in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuami nua in, ka zanmang in mengmuna ka mu a, gamsa lina, ginhuoi leh chizat umtah ahia ahat mama hi. Ama’n sia ha lien tahtah anei a, anegam a, abottel dimdem a, aneh mawhte akeng in atuonchil nalai hi. Gamsa masate toh akibang sih a, ki sawm anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua kite ka ngaituo lai in, tua kite lah, ki neu khat ahing poudoh a, tua ki neu masang ah ki masate lah a thumte bulkal khieh a bawdoh in a um hi. Tam kii in mihing mit bang mitte anei a, sil thupitahtah gen kam khat zong anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuabanga ka et laiin, mangtoupha khat ahing kidaw a, khanglui lai ni in atouna aluo dong ka en a, A puonsil vua bangin avam a, Alutunga samte samul siengtah bang ahi. Amangtoupha khu meikuong ahi a, atouna kengte khu meikuong lai bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meikuong luipi khat aluongkhie a, Ama kunga kipat a hing luongkhie ahi. Atul atul in Ama nna asem ua, tul sawm mun tul sawmte Amasangah ading uhi. Vaihawm thukhen pat ahita a, laibute akiphenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tuachi’n ken tua kii thugen sil thupitahte ziehin ka en nalai a, tua gamsa akithat a, atahsa suhsiet a um a, meikuonga haltum dinga, pieh ahi dongin ka en nalai lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gamsa dangte pen avaihawm thuneina uh lahmang pieh in a umta ua, hunbi khat leh hunkhat sung ahinna uh suhsau in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka zanlai mengmuna in ka en a, tualeh ngai vawi, Mihing Tapa bang Mikhat van meipite toh ahing pei a, Ama khangluilai Mi kungah ahing pei a, tualeh Ama khu Ama kungah ahing zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama kungah, vaihawmnate thuneinate, thupina leh leenggam, pieh in a um a, mi chin, nam chin leh hamchin a miten Ama nna asem ding uhi. Ama vaihawmna leenggam khu tawpni neilou ding kumtawn vaihawmna leenggam ahi a, tualeh aleenggam khu suhsiet a um ngailou ding leenggam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Kei Daniel ka tahsa sunga um ka lungsim alungkham a, ka lungsim a hing kilang mengmunate’n ahing lungbuoi sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka kunga dingte khat kungah ka va pei a, tam silte zousie tungtang a thutah ka va dongta hi. Tuachi’n Aman tam silte akhiehna ka kungah ang hil a, ahing theisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam gamsa lien tahtah lite khu, leitung apata hing umdoh ding leeng lite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Tungnung Sangpen misiengthouten leenggam ala ding ua, tua leenggam khu kumtawn kumtawn dong in anei den ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tuachi’n ken gamsa dangte toh kibanglou, agiinhuoi mama gamsa li na, ahate sia ha, achinte sum-eng hi, bottel dimdem a, negam a, aneh mawhte akenga tuonchilgawp pen tungtang thutah thei ka ut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh alutunga kii sawm poute tungtang leh kii dangkhat hing poudoh a, a masang a kii thumte puata, tungtang: tua kii in mitte nei leh sil thupitah genna kam nei a, amel latdan zong alawite sanga hattuoh zaw pen thu ka thei nuomta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuabang ka et lai in, tua kii mama in misiengthoute akidoupi a, amauh azouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khangluilai ni ahing pei a, Tungnung Sangpen misiengthoute kunga vaihawmna pieh in aum a tualeh misiengthouten, leenggam anei ding hun uh atun masangsie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Aman tambangin agen hi: Gamsa lina khu, leitunga leenggam lina ahi. Lenggam dangte zousie toh kikhiehna anei ding a, leitung pumpi negam ding leh, tuonchil in abotnen gawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua kii sawmte khu tam leenggam sung akipat hing dingkhe ding leeng sawmte ahi uhi; tualeh amauh nua ah, leeng dang khat ahing dingdoh dinga, amasate toh akibang sih dinga, Ama’n leeng thumte azou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama’n Tungnung Sangpen dou in thu thupitahtah agen dinga, Tungnung Sangpen misiengthoute asugenthei dinga, Hunte leh dan hen asawm ding a, Tuachi’n misiengthoute khu hun khat leh hunte leh hun kimkhat sung akhut sung a pieh ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh vaihawm thukhenna ah atou dinga, kumtawn dong a sumangthai ding leh negam dingin, avaihawmna alahmang pieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n leenggam leh thuneina, tualeh van nuoi pumpi a, leenggamte thupina khu, Tungnung sangpen misiengthou mite, kunga pieh ahita ding hi. Aleenggam khu kumtawn leenggam ahi a, leenggam vaihawm thunei zousiete’n, Ama abe ding ua, athu amang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tami athu tawpna ahita, Kei Daniel ka hileh, ka ngaituonate’n ahing subuoi mama a, ka melpuoh dan ahing kihengta hi; hinanleh sil umdante ka lungtang ah ka vom chinten hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Belshazzar leenga apan kum thum achin kum in, ka kungah, Kei Daniel kung ngelngel ah, kilahna masapen akilah zou nua in, kilahna khat ahing kilang kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka mengmuna ah, Elam gamkai a Shushan leeng innpi kulpi a ki-im sunga um hi in ka kithei a, tualeh mengmuna in ka mu a, Ulai lui gei ah ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka dahdoh leh lui gei a belamtal kii ni nei khat ding ka mu a, akiite gel asau a, hinanleh khatpen adangkhat pen sangin asau zaw a, hinanleh apou nukhia zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua belamtal in, tumlam, mallam leh simlam avih kawikawi in ka mu a, tuachi’n gamsa dangten ama adou zou sih ua, akhut apat hundoh zou koima a um sih a, a ut dan dan in sil abawl a ahing thupi mamata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh ka kingaituo laiin, thakhat in, amittegel kikaal a pou kii lienpi nei keltal khat tumlam akipat ahing pei a, tuol sukhalou in leitung pumpi ah apeisuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n lui gei a ding belamtal kii ni nei ka mu kungah ahing pei a, lungthah tah a hing tai in abaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh keltal in tua belamtal ahing zuon ka mu a, tualeh lungthahtah a belamtal asuh leh akii tegel asuhtawng piehta hi. Belamtal in ama nan zouna ding thahatna mawngmawng anei sih hi. Keltal in belamtal khu tuol ah asupua a, leilah ah atuonchil a, tualeh akhut apat a belamtal hunkhe thei koima a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuazieh in keltal khu nasatah in ahing khanglien ta a, hinanleh ahing hat laitah in, akilienpi khu atawngta hi, amun ah, van hui lite lam nga in kii lamdang li ahing poudoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua kiite lah a khat apat, kii neu khat ahing poudoh a, simlam, suolam leh gam thupi lam ah nasatah a thahat in ahing khanglienta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh van galkap hon tan aphah dongin akhangtou a, galkap hon lah leh aasite lah a lawikhat leilah ah apaikhesuh a, atuonchilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Van galkap hon leengtapa banga lien leh sang in ama leh ama akitawisanga, tualeh nisim kithoina sillatte alamanga, Amun siengthoumunte suhmang in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gitlouna ziehin galkap honpi leh nisim kithoina sillatte ama kunga pieh in a um hi; aman thutah khu tuolsena’n anei a, asep abawl ah amailam avanga, alawching zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken misiengthou khat in thu agen lai ka za a, misiengthou dang khat in tua misiengthou thugenpa kunga, “Nisim kithoinate, susegawppa bawlsietnate, munsiengthou leh galkap honte totchil a aumna ding tungtang a mengmuna khu bangtan a sawt ding ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh aman ka kungah, “Ni tul ni leh zathum tandong ahi dinga, tuazou chiengin munsiengthou siensuo ahi ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin hichi ahing hi a, Kei Daniel in, mengmuna ka mu tahin, akhiehna thei ka tum a, tualaitah in, thakhat in ka masangah mihing melpuohdan bang khat ahing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Ulai luipang tegel kikaal ah mihing aw khat ka za a, tua aw in, “Gabriel, tam mipa kungah mengmuna khu theisiem sah in,” achi ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama ka dinna kung nai ah ahing pei a, ahing pei tah in ka zau mama a, bohkhup in ka puata a, hinanleh aman ka kungah: “Aw mihing tapa, Theisiemin, mengmuna pen hun tawpna hun a ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin Kei ahing houpi lai in, leilah a bohkhup in nasatah in ka imuta hi, hinanleh Aman kei ahing khoi a, tangtah in ahing ding sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh aman “En in, lungthahna hun nukhia lam chienga sil hing um ding ka hing theisah ding hi, aziehpen hun tawpna ding hun guot ah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Belamtal kii ni nei na mu khu, Media leh Persia leengte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Keeltal khu Greece leengpa ahi a, amittegel kikaal a, kii lientah pen leengpa masapen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua akii tawngsan doh a, amun a kii-li hing poudoh pen khu, ama nam akipat leenggam li ahing dingdoh dinga, hinanleh ama silbawltheina ahisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh aleenggam uh hun nukhia lam chiengin takhielte aphahtawp uh ahing tun chiengun; leengpa mel giinhuoitah leh thugilou bawldante theisiem khat ahing khangdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asilbawltheina ahat dinga, hinanleh ama thahatna vang ahisih ding a, Aman giinhuoitah in asumang ding a, asep abawl ah alawching dinga; Aman mihatte leh misiengthoute asusegawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Apil khelna ziehin, solna akhut ah alawching sah dinga, alungtang in ama akitawisangdinga, nuomsatah a aumlai un mitampi asuse ding hi. Lengte Lengpa dou dingin adingdoh ding a, Hinanleh mihing khut hilouin, ama suhsiet in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh nitah lam leh zing mawng lam mengmuna kigensate khu adih ahi; Tuaziehin tam mengmuna pen mailam hun, ni tampi nua chieng toh kisai ahizieh in khahkhum in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh kei Daniel ka bagawpta a, ni tampi sung china in ka lum hi; tuazou in ka thoudoh a, leengpa nna ka sem hi. Tua mengmuna lamdang kasa a, ka theisiem sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kaldai gam sunga leengpa a bawl, piendan a Medes mi Ahasuerus tapa Darius leeng apan kum, akum khatna kum in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Avaihawm kum khatna kum in Kei Daniel in guolnei Jeremiah kunga Mangpa’n thu agen Jerusalem sietna kum sawmsagi dai ding ahi chi, laibute apat in ka theisiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa Pasian lam nga in, thumna leh ngetna, anngawlna leh sai-ippuon sil in, vutvai lah a kilawmlie in ka thum ngetngut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa ka Pasian kungah ka thum a, akung ah: Khelnaphuonna ka nei a, “Aw Mangpa Pasian thupi leh chizat huoi, Ama itte leh athupieh zuite kunga thuhun leh khotuona vomzingpa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Koute kana khielta ua, silgilou ka na bawlta uhi; giloutah in kana gamta ua, tualeh kana helta uhi; Na thuhilnate leh Na danthute kana pielmangsanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka leengte u’leh ka miliente u’leh, Kapu ka pate u’leh gam sunga mi zousiete kunga Na min a thu na gen na suoh guolneite thugen ka na ngaikheta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Mangpa dihtatna khu Nanga ahi a, hinanleh tuni a mabangin koute adingin maizumna ahi; Juda mite, Jerusalem a tengte leh Israel mi zousiete na tung a amuonhuoi louna zieh ua, anai leh agamla leh gam chin a, na tunga gitlouna abawl zieh ua, na delzahte lah tuabangma ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na tunga ka na kheltah zieh un maizumna koute leh ka leengte u’leh ka miliente u’leh ka pu ka pate u’tung ah atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa i Pasian kungah khotuona leh ngaidamna a um a, Ama tungah na helta nanlei zong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asuoh guolneite zanga, Ka masang ua akoi adante zuiin, Mangpa Ka Pasian uh aw ka na ngaikhe sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi, Israelte zousie in, na aw angaikhiet louna ding un hing lampielsan in, na dan abawtseta uhi. Tuaziehin Pasian suohpa Mosi danbu sunga kigiel hamsietna leh kihahsielna ka tung uah sunbuoh in a umta hi; Atunga kana kheltah zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Aman ka tung ua vangsietna thupitah hing tutin koute tung leh ka vaihawm-thukhente uh tunga athugen asudetta hi; aziehpen Jerusalem tunga kibawl bangin vannuoi pumpi zong akibawlkha ngai nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosi dan a kigiel bangin tam vangsietna zousie ka tung uah ahing tunga, hinanleh kouten ka khelnate ua pat hing kihei a na thutah ka theisiem theina ding un, Mangpa ka Pasian uh masang ah thungetna ka neikha nalai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n vangsietnate ana koizinga, ka tung uah ahing tung sahta hi, aziehpen Mangpa ka Pasian u’khu asilbawl zousie a dihtat ahi a, kouten A aw ka mangtuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh tuin Aw Mangpa ka Pasian uh, Izipt gam a kipat a na mite khut hattah a hing puidoh a, tunia ma banga na min umden ding a kibawlpa aw, koute ka na khielta ua, giloutah in ka bawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka hing ngen ahi, na dihtatna zousie dungzuiin, na khopi Jerusalem, na muol siengthou apat in, na thangpaina leh na lungthahna kiheimangsah in, aziehpen ka khelnate uleh kapu ka pate uh thulimlounate ziehin Jerusalem leh na mite ka kim ka vel ua umte zousiete simmaw in ka umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin Aw ka Pasian uh tuin, na suohpa thumna leh thungetna ngaikhie inlen, akisesa na munsiengthou tungah Mangpa ziehin na mel tangsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw ka Pasian na bil hingdaw inlen, ngai in, Na mit hah inlen, ka sietdan uleh na min a kihan khopi khu en in; ka dihtatnate u’zieh a ka thungetnate uh na masanga hing tut ka hisih ua, na khotuona thupitah zieh ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ngai in! Aw Mangpa ngaidam in! Aw Mangpa ngaikhie inlen bawlin, Nangma min ziehin zekai sin; Ka Pasian aw, na khopi leh na mite khu Nangma min a kilou a hi uhi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin ka thugen lai, ka thum lai leh ka khelna leh ka mi Israelte khelnate phuonga, Mangpa ka Pasian masanga, muol siengthou a dinga, thungetnate ka tut lai in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ahi, thungetna a thu ka gen lai in, mengmuna amasalam a ka mu pa Gabriel khu nitahlam kithoina sillat hun vel in hattah in ahing leenga ka kungah ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman thu ahing hil a, ahing houpi a, ka kungah, “Aw Daniel, pilna leh theisiemna hing pe dingin tuin ka hing pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na thunget chiil apat in, thupieh apawtdoh a, nang hing hil dinga hing pei ka hi; aziehpen nang nahpitah a itpa na hi a, tuazieh in athu ngaituo inlen, mengmuna theisiem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tawnkhelna suhbeina ding leh khelnate tawpna bawl ding leh, gitlouna a dinga kilemna bawlna ding leh kumtawn dihtatna lahlutna ding leh mengmuna leh genlawhna khakhumna ding leh Munsieng thou pen sathau nuna dingin, na mite leh na khopi Siengthou tungah hapta sawmsagi guot ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuazieh in thei inlen theisiem in, Jerusalem tungding kia ding leh lamtha dinga thupieh apawtdoh akipata Mang Messiah hing tun dongchieng, hapta sawmguh leh ni ahi dinga, agawl zingte leh akul baangte, hun buoihuoilaitah sunga kilam ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh hapta sawmguh leh ni zou chiengin, Messiah satkhieh in a um ding a, bangma anei sih ding hi; tualeh ahing pei ding leengpa miten khopi leh munsiengthou asuse ding uhi, tualeh hun tawpna khu tuisanglet bangin ahing tung ding a, atawp dongin kidouna a um dinga, sietnate pen guotsa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh aman mi tampite toh thuhun kiptah hapta khat sunga ding abawl dinga, tualeh hapta kimkhat ah kithoina leh sillatte atawpsah ding hi, tualeh akidahhuoinate uh atam sengtah luot zieh in, aman asegawpsah dinga, atawp tandong in ahing tung ding a, guotsa lungthahna susegawpmi tung ah sunbuoh in a um ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Persia leengpa Sairas vaihawm kum thumna ah amin Belteshazzar kichi Daniel kungah kilahna khat pieh in a um hi. Tua kilahna thupuoh adih a, hinanleh ahun kiguot asau a, tualeh aman tua thupuoh khu atheisiem a, tualeh mengmuna theisiemna anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua nite sungin, Kei Daniel in hapta thum sung pumpi ka suun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ann tuitah ka ne sih a, zu leh sa mawngmawng ka kam sungah alut sih a, ahisihleh hapta thum achin masangsie in sathau zong ka kinu vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuin aha khatna ni sawmni leh li niin, Tigris luipi lien gei a ka din laiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka dahtou a ka et leh, Ngaivawi, puonmalngat sil mi koi ahiei khat, akawng Uphaz sana chiimtah a kigah ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tahsa pumpi beril suong mantam abanga, amaitang kilatdan tunphe abanga, amittegel meisel kuong bang ahi a, abante leh akengte sum-eng nawtval bang leh a aw suoh ging khu mitampi aw ging bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua mengmuna mu Kei Daniel maimai in ka mu ahi a, ka kunga um miten amu sih uhi; hinanleh zauna chizat huoi atung uah atunga, tuachi’n ataizah ua, akibu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin tami mengmuna ka mu laiin keimatang a nuasie in ka um a, tualeh thalezung mawngmawng ka neita sih hi; tualeh ka mel lah mishi mel bangin amuol a, thahatna mawngmawng ka nei nawnta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh athugen ging ka za a, tualeh athugen ging ka zah lai in, ka mai lei lam a kunsuh in ka bohkhupa, ka mai tuolsu in nuomtahin ka na imu hit hietta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n thakhat in khut khat in ahing khoi a, tuami’n ka khutphang leh ka khupte a kingam in chitun kawmkawm in ahing phongtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman ka kungah “Aw Daniel nasatah a itpa na kunga ka thugente theisiem inlen dingtangin, azieh pen na kunga kei hing kisawl ahi” achi hi. Tam thu ka kunga agenlai in, chitun kawm in ka dingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, “Zausin Daniel, theisiemna deina zieh leh na Pasian mai a kingaingiem dinga, na lungsim na pieh ni masapen apat, na thugente zah ahita a, tualeh na thute zieh a kei hing pei ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Persia gam uhpipan ni sawmni leh khat sung ahing doudal a, hinanleh en vawi Mikael houtute lah a lienpen khat kei hing panpi dingin ahing pei a, khunah keimatangin Persia leengte toh nuasie in ka umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n ni nukhialam chienga, na mite tunga bang ahiei hing tung ding chi, hing theisiem sah ding a hing pei ka hi, mengmuna lah nitampi nua chienga ding ahi bou hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam thute ka kunga agen sungin, ka mai tuol suin ka kunsuh a, hamtheilou in ka umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh thakhat in, mihing tapate mel bang puo mi khat in ka nephute ahing khoipieh a, tuachi’n ka kam ka kaah a, tualeh thu ka genta a, ka mai a dingpa kungah, “Aw ka mangpa, mengmuna ziehin lungkhamna leh patauna in ka dim a, thalezung mawngmawng ka neita sih hi, kachi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam ka mangpa suohpa’n bangchin ka mangpa ahoupi thei diei? Ken lah thalezung mawngmawng ka nei nawnta sih a, ka nah hu nangawn a um zou nawn sih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua mihing mel bang popa’n ahing khoikia a, ahing asuhatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh aman “Nahpitah a itpa aw, zau sin, na kung ah hamuonna um heh, hattah in um inlen, ahi hat in” ahing chi hi, Tuabanga ahing houpi lai in, “Kei khu hatsah in ka umta hi. Ka Mangpa aw, Nangman na hing suhhattah ziehin, Ka Mangpa’n thu gen heh,” ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman: “Na kunga bangzieh a hing haw ka hiei chi na thei ei? Tualeh tuin Persia leengpa dou dingin ka kilekia pai dinga, ka peidoh zou chiengin Greek leengpa ahing kuon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh Laisiengthou sunga kigiel Thutah nang kang hil ding, na Mangpa Mikael chiloungal ahing doupi thei ding koima a um sih hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mede mi Darius vaihawm kum, akum khatna kum in, keima mama ama sudet ding leh suhat dingin ka dingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tuin thutah kang hil ding hi: Ngai in, Persia gam sungah leeng thum ahing dingdoh nalai dinga, alina pen adangteng sanga hausa zaw tham ahi ding; ahausatna zieh a athahatna in Greek leenggam pumpi dou dingin mi zousie atohthou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n vangletna thupitah toh vaihawm ding leeng hattah khat ahing dingdoh dinga, a utdan danin agamta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama ahing dindoh hun chiengin a leenggam akehzah dinga, kawlkil li ah khenzah in a um ding hi, hinanleh ahah asuonte kungah lah hilou ahisihleh avangletna a, avaihawmna lah hidiehlou in, aleenggam pen bawdoh a, tam mite hilou midangte kunga pieh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tuachi’n simlam leengpa ahing hat dinga, alamkaite lah a khat ama sangin ahatzaw ding a, thuneina anei ding hi. Athuneina khu thuneina thupitah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumbangza ahiei nuachiengin, amaute ahing kizomkhawm ding ua, simlam leengpa tanu khu mallam leengpa kungah pangkhawm dinga kinoptuona bawl dingin ahing pei ding hi, hinanleh amanu’n athahatna vangletna aneiden sih ding a, tualeh amapa zong athuneina ading zou tuom sih ding hi, hinanleh tua hun a amanu hing zawpite leh ama hingtu apa leh ama suhatpa toh piehdoh in a umta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Hinanleh amanu zungzamte ba meng khat apat mi khat ama mun ah ahing dingdoh dinga, ama galkap hon toh ahing kuon dinga, mallam leengpa kul sung ah alut dinga, tualeh amauh adou dinga, azou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman a pasiente uh, amilimsunthute u’leh dangka leh sana a kibawl a um leh bel manphate uh Izipt gam lam ah apomang ding hi. Aziehpen ama’n kum bangza ahiei sung mallam leengpa dou lou a khawlsan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n mallam leengpa’n simlam leengpa asim dinga, hinanleh ama gamlam mama ah akinualekia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ahivang in atapate gal dou dingin akitawhthou ding ua, galkap hon tamtah akhawm khawm ding ua, tualeh galkap honten tuisanglet bangin anawh ding ua, simlam leengpa kulpi dong adou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh simlam leengpa alungthah mama in ahing kuonkhe dinga, mallam leengpa toh akidou ding uhi. Tualeh galkap hon thupitah nei nanleh a guollel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua galkap honte a puimang tah chiengin alungtang ahing kiliensah ding a, mi tul tampi athat dinga, hinanleh aguolzou den sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen mallam leengpa ahing peikia ding a, amasanga sanga tamzaw tham mipi tamtah toh ahing kuondoh dinga, kum bangza ahiei nuachieng in, galkap hon leh galvan tamtah toh ahing kuon ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tua hun chiengin, simlam leengpa douin mi tampi ahing dingdoh ding ua, na mite lah apat in hiemngamte mengmuna sutangtung dingin ahing kitawisang ding ua, hinanleh aguollel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n mallam leengpa ahing kuon dinga, kidouna leipalte atou ding a lei asepvum dinga khopi kulpi nei khat ala dinga, tualeh simlam leengpa galkapten anang zou sih ding uhi; ami hat teltuomte nangawn in zong, nan zouna ding thahatna anei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh ama dou dinga hing kuonpa’n a ut dan dan in abawl dinga, amai a ding zou koima a um sih ding hi. Ama gam thupi ah adingdoh dinga, akhut suhsiet in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A leenggam pumpi thahatna zousie toh hing lut atum dinga, midihte ama toh tambangin abawl ding hi. Tualeh a kungah numeite tanu susiet ding in akungah ape dinga, hinanleh amanu ama toh apangkhawm sih dinga, amapa ading zong ahisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuazouchiengin aman amai tuipi gei gamte lam ah ahei dinga, tua gamte tampi ala ding hi. Hinanleh vaihawm lien khat in akisahtheina khu atawpsah dinga, ami gensietna khu ama tung mama ah atusah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama gam lam kulpite ah amai ahei kia dinga, hinanleh akipal dinga, apua ding hi, tualeh mukhah ahinawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Ama mun ah mi khat leenggam thupina a siekhon mi khat ahing dingdoh dinga hinanleh ni tomnoukhat sungin, lungthahna zieh hilou kidouna zieh zong hilouin suhmang in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh ama mun ah misimmawhuoi khat ahing dingdoh dinga, akungah leenggam zatatna apesih ding uhi; hinanleh lemna thu toh ahing kuon dinga, zebawlna toh leenggam asim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuisan luong banga galkap hon thahatna in amai akipan in phietmangin a um ding ua, asuse gawp ding ua, thuhun leengtapa nangawn zong suhmang thai in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh ama toh kithukimna abawlzoutah chiengin zuoutat tahin abawl dinga, mi tawmnoukhat toh thuneina nei in ahing khangkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Galmuongtah in gamkai sunga mun hausa penpen te ah alut ding a, apate leh a puten abawl ngailou uh sil ahing bawl dinga, amaute lah ah gallah vante leh gallah sumte leh ahausatnate ahawmzah ding hi; kulpi dettahte sim dingin aguh in thu aphiel dinga, hinanleh hun tomnoukhat sung ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Simlam leengpa kidoupi dingin galkap hon thupitah toh, asilbawltheina leh ahansanna atohthou ding hi. Tualeh simlam leengpa zong galdou dingin agalkap hon tampitah leh hattahte toh tawhthou in a umta ding hi; hinanleh ama douna dinga athuguh phielte zieh un ading zou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi, ama ann tuitah nete mama in ama asumangthai ding ua, agalkap honte phietmang in a um dinga, mitampite tha in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tam leengte gel, silgilou tupna lungtang pokawm in, dawkan khat ah a toukhawm ding ua, zuouthu agenkhawm ding uhi, hinanleh alawching sih ding ua, atawpna ding pen ahun guotsa a hing tung ding ahizieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mallam leengpa hausatna thupitah toh agam lam a akinuale kia lai in, a lungtang in thuhun siengthou adou ding a, a dei bang bangin abawl ding a, tuachi’n ama gam lam ah akile kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Hun kiguotsa ah ahing kinuale kia dinga, simlam ah akuon dinga, hinanleh amasang a bang khu, a nua ah ahinawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aziehpen Saipras apat tembawhte ama dou dingin ahing kuon ding ua, tuazieh in ama alunggim mama dinga, thuhun siengthou dou dingin lungthah tahin akinuale dinga, a ut ut in abawl ding hi. Tuachi’n ahing kinuale kia ding a thuhun siengthou nuangat a taisante tungah deisahna alangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh galkapte ama lam ah apang ding ua, amaun munsiengthou kulpite asubua ding ua, tuachi’n nisim kithoina sillatte alamang dinga, sietna tuntu kidahhuoi atungdoh zawta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Giloutah a thuhun dou mite maitangphat in a suse ding hi, hinanleh a Pasian uh thei mite pen ahat ding ua, sil thupitah abawldoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh mite lah a theisiemna neiten mi tampite athuhil ding uhi, hinanleh ni tampi sung namsau leh meikuong, saltaana leh gallah vante in apua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Apua chiengun panpina themkhat amu ding uhi, hinanleh mitampiten akamsiemna utoh abel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh theisiemna nei mite lah a lawikhat halsieng ding, suhsieng ding leh huntawp donga suhsiengthou ahi theina dingun apua ding uhi, aziehpen hun guotsa a ding ahi nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Tuachi’n leengpa’n ama utdan dan in sil abawl ding a, pasien chinteng tungah kitawisang in ama leh ama kipahtawi in akikoisang ding a, pasiente Pasian dou in thumahtahte agen ding a, thangpaina hun suhbukim ahi masangsie alawching ding hi; aziehpen guot a umsa sil kibawl teitei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aman apu apate Pasian ahita zong in numeite lunggul ahita zong in ahisihleh, pasien dang mawng mawng zong zatatna ape sih ding a, tuate zousie tunglam ah ama leh ama akipahtawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute mun ah kulpite pasien azatat zaw dinga, apulepate theingailou pasien, sana, dangka leh suongmantamte leh sil hoi tahtahte in azatatbawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tambangin ama’n gamdang pasien panpina toh kulpi detpente adou dinga, ama’n atheipi dinga, athupinain akhangsah ding hi, tualeh amaute mi tampite tung ah vai ahawmsah dinga, punna ding in gam ahawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Atawpna hun ah simlam leengpa’n ama ahing dou ding a, mallam leengpa zong ama dou dingin pingpei bang mai in sakolleng toh, sakol tungtuong mi toh, tembawh tampi toh, ahing kuon ding hi; tualeh gamte ah alut ding a, tualeh amaute atummang ding a, apei galkai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama gam Thupitah ah zong alut dinga, tualeh gam tampite azou ding hi; hinanleh tamte akhut apat asuohta ding uhi: Edom leh Moab tualeh Ammon mipi lamkai liente bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ama’n gamte tung ah akhut alaam ding a, Izipt gam asuohta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama’n Izipt gam a sana, dangka leh gou manphate zousie tung ah thu anei dinga, Libia mite leh Ethiopia mite in aketot azui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hinanleh simlam akipat leh mallam akipat thuthangte’n ama apatausah ding a, tuazieh in mi tampi sumang ding leh suchimit kilkel ding in ama lungthah tah in akuondoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tualeh aman aleeng puonbuhte tuipi leh amuol siengthou thupitah kikaal ah azah dinga, hinanleh atawp in ama beina ahing tung dinga koiman ama apanpi vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tua hun chiengin na mite tapate dinga na ding zelpa, lamkai thupitah Mikael adingdoh dinga, Namte um chiil a kipat tuni hun donga na umkha ngainailou lungdon chizatna hun ahing um ding: tualeh tua hun chiengin na mite laibu sunga min kigiel kimukha pouma hutdohin a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh alah ua mi tampi leitunga leivui lah a imute khu ahing khanglouta ding ua, kimkhatte kumtawn hinna tang dingin, tualeh kimkhatte zumna leh kumtawn simmawna tang ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh apilte pen van a vahnate bangin ataang ding ua, tualeh mi tampi dihtatna lam a heite khu aasite bangin kumtawn kumtawn in ataang denta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh nang aw Daniel thute khahkhum inlen, laibu khu atawp hun tan adingin kha in; mi tampi asuhtai atoutai ding ua, theina apung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kei Daniel in ka en a, tualeh ngai in, mi dang ni ka mai ah a ding uhi; khat lui gei tamlang pang ah, tualeh khat pen luigei khumlang pang ah, a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh khat in, puonmalngat sil a lui tuite tunga umpa kungah, Tam sil lamdangte tawpna ding bangtan a sawt ding ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n puonmalngat sil a lui tuite tunga umpa in akhut zietlam leh akhut veilam vanlam ah azahtou a, Ama kumtawn a ahing zingpa min a kichiem in, hun khat leh hunte leh hun kimkhat sung ahi ding a, tualeh Misiengthoute thuneina asiet dimdem nua chiengin, tam silte zousie zaw ahita ding achi ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Keima’n kaza a hinanleh ka theisiem sih hi. Tuachi’n “Aw ka Mangpa, tam silte tawpna bang hi ding ahiei?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Ama’n Daniel aw, “Na peina ding ah peita in; aziehpen tawpna hun dong a dinga thute khah leh sinkhum ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tampite suhsiengthou ahi ding ua, suhngou ahi ding ua, sienthousah in a um ding uhi; hinanleh migilouten giloutah in abawl ding ua, migiloute lah a koima’n atheisiem sih ding ua, hinanleh mipilten atheisiem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh nichin kithoina sillat lahmang ahi a, sietna bawltu kidahhuoi tundoh ahi hun akipat in ni tul khat zani leh sawmkuo a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koi zong ni tul khat leh zathum leh sawmthum leh nga, ngah kenkon a, tua huntan tung mi khu mi hampha ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh nang pen atawpna atun masangsiein na peina ding ah peita in, na khawldam dinga, nite tawpna ah, na gouluona mun ah na thoudoh ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
